    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to bring this wonderful four bedroom detached family home with large outbuilding to the market on magnificent gardens extending to approximately 0.23 hectare/ 0.56 acre. Approached through secure electric entrance gates guaranteeing privacy for its occupants, this impressive, unique residence extending to approximately 216sq. m. / 2357 sq.ft. is beautifully positioned on a wonderfully private, landscaped site in a sought after village setting with convenience to all amenities required for modern living. This really is the perfect family home. From the moment you enter this impressive residence, one is immediately hit with a sense of space & light.Central to this home is a bright and spacious, family friendly open plan kitchen, living, breakfast room with luxurious fitted kitchen, island with quartz countertops, an array of appliances, tiled floor and a solid fuel cooker. The sun room just off the kitchen area has a vaulted ceiling and oak flooring and triple aspect with views of the wonderful gardens which are just a joy to behold, lush with colour and beautifully landscaped. There is also three spacious bedrooms with (one ensuite), bathroom and utility on the ground floor level. The first floor accommodation consists of a spacious bedroom with ensuite, a games roomand den / study. Internally this home offers the ultimate comforts of modern contemporary living with high specification features and finishes throughout. Externally the residence is finished with a wonderful low maintenance finish with a slate roof. There is a dual heating system oil and solid fuel, pvc double glazed windows and an array of attractive featuresA combination of trees and mature hedges on all boundaries creates a true oasis of privacy and security. Generous manicured lawns, tarmac driveway, patio area and a wide range of beautiful trees and flowers provide wonderful colour seclusion and tranquility. The property also comes complete with TV, Telephone and Broadband connection which allows easy streaming of the internet for smart TV s Netflix etcThe current owners have really put their own stamp on this property finishing the internal decoration with neutral and stylish pieces and breathtaking landscaped grounds, whereby the new owner will have little to do but move straight in.Staplestrown is a sought after village setting convenient to the reknowned Donadea forest park with some excellent trails and walks is located just a few minutes away whilst large populations centres such as Maynooth, Kilcock, Clane and Prosperous are approximately 10 mins drive where one can find excellent shops, schools, churches, pubs, restaurants, cafes and a host of recreational facilities. Dublin city and its surrounding areas (just 45 minutes away) are easily accessible via frequent bus services, commuter rail links at Sallins and Maynooth and easy access to both the M4 and M7 motorways.Viewing is a must to fully appreciate all the magnificent attributes that this wonderful home offers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.3m x 2.5m\nWith tiled flooring, recessed lighting, radiators cabinet.\n\nLounge - 5.0m x 3.8m\nOpen plan off kitchen, laminate flooring, bay window, tv point.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.8m x 4.0m\nWith fitted kitchen, Rayburn solid fuel cooker, Neff induction hob 80cm, Neff extractor fan, Neff hide & slide single oven, Neff Microwave Combi Oven, Bosch integrated dishwasher, island with Quartz countertop, recessed lighting, tiled floor, tiled splashback, French doors to rear.\n\nSun Room - 3.8m x 3.8m\nWith oak flooring, vaulted ceiling.\n\nUtility Room - 2.8m x 2.8m\nWith fitted kitchen, sink unit, tiled floor, tiled splashback, integrated fridge, rear door access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1m x 3.2m\nTo front with extensive fitted wardrobes, oak flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.3m x 3.8m\nTo front with oak flooring, bay window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 3.2m\nTo back with extensive fitted wardrobes, oak flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.9m x 1.4m\nWith Mira pump shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, shower screen.\n\nBathroom - 4.0m x 2.0m\nWith bath, seperate shower, Triton T90si electric shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled splashback, shower screen.\n\nCorridor - 7.1m x 1.0m\nWith oak flooring, airing cupboard, recessed lighting, radiator cabinet.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.8m x 4.8m\nWith laminate flooring, roof windows.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.6m x 1.8m\nWith shower, wc, vanity whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, shower screen, heated towel rail, Demister mirror, recessed lighting.\n\nGames Room - 4.8m x 4.8m\nWith laminate flooring, roof window.\n\nDen - 5.6m x 4.8m\nWith laminate flooring, roof windows.\n\nSpecial Features - \nPatio area with pizza oven and raised bedsTarmac driveway, Electronic entrance gatesGarden shedLarge shed 20 ft wide 30 ft length. Electric Hanger DoorWonderful landscaped grounds, Outside tapDriveway lights.\n\n"
